# Whitelist: the build consumes exactly these paths; everything else stays
# out of the context no matter what the local tree holds.
#
# `executor/torch_exec.py` is here because `src/torch_engine.rs` embeds it with
# `include_str!`: the python executor must exist at COMPILE time even for the
# CPU image, which never runs it. Dropping it from the context fails the build.
*
!Cargo.toml
!Cargo.lock
!src
!executor
!docker/cc1_build.sh
